				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2019 23:32:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>N_Aepic_Fael</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4463776</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This image is a conglomerate, part of which comes from <a href="https://www.overstock.com/Sports-Toys/Neo-Assault-Katana-Blade-Sword/1045548/product.html">here</a>, which holds everything under a restrictive copyright that prevents reuse of content without contacting the website first. As such, it is non-compliant with the CC 3.0 license and has been removed.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-122293#post-4168213</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-122293/scp-572#post-4168213</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 28 Feb 2019 08:25:46 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>GriffinPilgrim</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1324681</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That's a little harsh. I upvoted before I even knew it was a Clef skip because I enjoyed the idea. I do agree it should be Safe but uncontained this could very easily get a lot of people killed. If you don't know what it does it could have a chain effect as each user goes down and someone else picks it up. It's a funny effect, certainly, but it is a genuine threat to life and limb in-universe and that's enough for me. They don't all have to be apocalyptic.<br /> If you don't like it, fine, fair enough, but assuming why others choose to vote the way they do without asking is presumptuous.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
